    <summaries>
      <summary>
        <versionCode>07</versionCode>
        <actionDate>2026-07-02</actionDate>
        <actionDesc>Reported to House</actionDesc>
        <updateDate>2026-07-16T21:39:21Z</updateDate>
        <text><![CDATA[<p>This bill reauthorizes through FY2030 activities of the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention to address vector-borne diseases (e.g., diseases spread by bites from ticks or mosquitoes). These activities include (1) a national strategy, (2) grants for regional centers of excellence, and (3) cooperative agreements with state, local, and tribal health departments&nbsp;to increase capacity for preventing and responding to vector-borne diseases.</p>]]></text>
      </summary>
    </summaries>
